19 0 obj
<<
/Dest [ 7 0 R /Fit ] /Next 20 0 R /Parent 17 0 R /Prev 18 0 R /Title (WHAT HAPPENEDNICE announced the integration of its acquired Cognigy capabilities into its CXone platform, aiming to deliver a unified agentic AI experience. This move consolidates two AI lineages under the NICE umbrella, with new features like "Guardian Agent" for governance and an "Agentic Engagement Plane" CX Today.)
>>
endobj
20 0 obj
<<
/Dest [ 7 0 R /Fit ] /Next 21 0 R /Parent 17 0 R /Prev 19 0 R /Title (Agentforce Moves to Production, Highlighting Salesforce's Agentic Ambitions)
>>
endobj
21 0 obj
<<
/Dest [ 7 0 R /Fit ] /Next 22 0 R /Parent 17 0 R /Prev 20 0 R /Title (WHAT HAPPENEDSalesforce's Agentforce platform has transitioned from pilot to production, with the company pledging significant investment in Switzerland and emphasizing the platform's enterprise readiness. This move signals Salesforce's aggressive push to embed agentic AI across its ecosystem, including contact centers MarketScale.)
>>
endobj
22 0 obj
<<
/Dest [ 7 0 R /Fit ] /Next 23 0 R /Parent 17 0 R /Prev 21 0 R /Title (ServiceNow Highlights AI Governance as a Key Buying Trigger)
>>
