/Dest [ 7 0 R /Fit ] /Parent 17 0 R /Prev 22 0 R /Title (WHAT HAPPENEDServiceNow's Q2 earnings report indicated that AI governance is increasingly becoming a critical factor for enterprise customers in their purchasing decisions. This suggests a growing market awareness and demand for robust control and compliance features in AI deployments ERP Today.)
>>
endobj
